  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_h000109",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Mizuki",
   "Line": "<I, uhh...! Remember how she said she was having trouble with her rough draft?! I was worried, so um... How's it going...?>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_e000303",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Ena",
   "Line": "<About that...\nI'm sorry but I'm gonna need a little more time.>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_h000309",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Mizuki",
   "Line": "<What?>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_h000308",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Mafuyu",
   "Line": "<You're still not happy with it?>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_e000303",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Ena",
   "Line": "<That's a part of the reason...>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_e000403",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_e000303",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Ena",
   "Line": "<I'm thinking about relearning how to draw.>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_h000107",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Kanade",
   "Line": "<Relearn?>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_e000303",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Ena",
   "Line": "<Yeah. There's this art class I used to attend and am thinking about going back...>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Ena",
   "Line": "<In my current state, I feel like I won't be able to draw anything decent for this song or anything that comes after it...>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Ena",
   "Line": "<I promise to finish this draft and not do anything that holds the rest of you back.>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_h000309",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Mizuki",
   "Line": "<...!\nYeah! You should go!>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_e000403",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Mizuki",
   "Line": "<Um, I mean... I'm okay with you going... What about you, K, Yuki?>",
