   "Line": "bg_e000303",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Ena",
   "Line": "<You could phrase that a little better, Yuki, but thanks, you guys...>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Ena",
   "Line": "<I promise to learn how to really illustrate the song you two wrote, K, Yuki.>",
